{
  "_about": "Hand-checked answers for the fictional vendors in data/vendor_web/corpus.json, as of 2026-11-01. eval/run_eval.py scores the assessor against this file. In your own project you write this file by researching a few real vendors by hand (see data/gold_set_template.json). It is the most valuable asset you will own: every bug you find in production becomes a new case here.",
