      "notes": "The stale 2024 security page (SOC 2 Type I in progress, no SSO) must lose to the 2026 trust centre. The review-site claim 'SSO only on Enterprise' must lose to the official 'Business and Enterprise'. The blog with the injection must be quarantined and its 'stores data in India' claim must never reach the report."
